menu "BORING boot guard"

    config WMP_CRASH_FAULT_INJECTION
        bool "TEST ONLY: scripted boot crashes"
        default n
        help
            Never enable for a release. Each boot after a warm reset runs one
            scripted fault 3 s into the main loop: a main-loop stall (task
            watchdog via liveness), then two aborts; the fourth boot is the
            safe-mode boot and later boots run normally. A power-on reset
            restarts the script. Built only with tools/build.sh
            --crash-fault-injection.

endmenu
